course: dictionary
lesson: 9506
title: Steroid: one word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the words around them show you which meaning is needed. Steroid is one of these words. «Steroid creams used as the doctor says keep eczema calm.» The words creams, doctor and eczema are the clues. They tell you a steroid here is a medicine.
explain: «Athletes can be banned for taking steroids to cheat.» Athletes, banned and cheat are the clues this time. Here steroids are drugs that some people take to build muscles, and that is against the rules. Always ask: which meaning fits these clues best?
explain: «It's like a skateboard on steroids.» On steroids is an informal phrase, and the clues show it is a joke, not a medicine. Try the swap: «It's like a skateboard that is extra powerful» still makes sense, so on steroids means much bigger or stronger than usual.
fact: A steroid is a kind of chemical, made in the body or as a medicine, that can calm swelling.
fact: Steroid creams and steroid inhalers are medicines doctors give for eczema and asthma.
fact: Anabolic steroids are drugs some people take to build muscles, and this is often against sports rules and can harm health.
fact: «On steroids» is an informal phrase meaning much bigger or stronger than usual.
fact: «A preventer inhaler contains a steroid that calms airway swelling over time and only works if taken every day.»
exercise: «Steroid creams for flare-ups are used as the doctor says.» What is a steroid cream here? | *A medicine that calms swelling, given by a doctor | A kind of cloud | A type of skateboard | A sweet drink for the sports team
exercise: «Athletes can be banned for taking steroids to cheat.» What do steroids mean in this sentence? | *Drugs some people take to build muscles, against sports rules | Shoes that make you run faster in a race | Tiny chemicals that make the sky blue | A kind of fruit juice
exercise: «It's like a skateboard on steroids.» What does on steroids mean? | *Much bigger or stronger than usual | Very slow and quiet | Sold in a shop for pets | Made of wood
test: «A preventer inhaler contains a steroid that calms airway swelling over time.» What does steroid mean here? | *A chemical medicine that calms swelling | A breathing game for children | A type of sports shoe | A sound a whistle makes
test: «Steroids are not protein; they can damage the heart and liver.» What does this sentence warn us about? | Steroids always make the heart stronger | Protein and steroids are the same thing | Steroids are good for your teeth | *Steroids can harm the body
exam: Which word in «Steroid creams used as the doctor says are safe» is the best clue that steroid means a medicine? | properly | thin | used | *doctor
